# Keep the image build context limited to files needed to compile Quorum and
# describe/test the container contract.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!LICENSE
!README.md
!.claude/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/quorum/
!.claude/skills/quorum/SKILL.md
!quorum/
!quorum/**
!quorum-core/
!quorum-core/**
!docker/
!docker/**

# Re-exclude non-build inputs that may appear inside allowlisted trees:
# VCS metadata, build output, managed worktrees, local Quorum state and
# databases, and credential material. docker/content-verify.sh asserts the
# resulting context stays free of these and within its size bound.
**/.git
**/target
**/worktrees
**/.quorum
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/auth.json
**/.credentials.json
**/.git-credentials
**/id_rsa*
**/id_dsa*
**/id_ecdsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
